<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on 6.0 pct Bund due 2007.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on 6.0 pct Bund due 2007.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schweizerischer Bankverein (Deutschland) has issued 60 million American-style call and put warrants, in six equal tranches, on the 6.0 pct Bund due 2007, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS    STRIKE	 ISS PRICE    PREMIUM     GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	103.0 PCT    1.85 DEM     0.88 PCT    56.18 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL B	104.0 PCT    1.41 DEM     1.41 PCT    73.72 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL C	105.0 PCT    1.04 DEM     1.89 PCT    99.94 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT D	  99.0 PCT    1.73 DEM     6.42 PCT    60.08 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT E	 100.0 PCT    2.12 DEM     5.83 PCT    49.03 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT F	 101.0 PCT    2.57 DEM     5.30 PCT    40.44 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 25.FEB.97-16.MAR.98   PAYDATE	24.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT DDF		   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  103.94 PCT</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
